{"text": "Now, stop lines and crosswalks. At an intersection controlled by a stop sign, a yield sign, or a traffic light, there can be a white line painted across your lane, called a stop line. There can also be two parallel lines painted across the road, called a crosswalk, or there can be both. When a sign or a light makes you stop, you must stop before you reach the stop line, if there is one. If there isn't, stop before the crosswalk.", "words": [{"i": 0, "start": 111, "end": 361}, {"i": 1, "start": 472, "end": 819}, {"i": 2, "start": 833, "end": 1180}, {"i": 3, "start": 1194, "end": 1277}, {"i": 4, "start": 1291, "end": 2124}, {"i": 5, "start": 2583, "end": 2694}, {"i": 6, "start": 2708, "end": 2791}, {"i": 7, "start": 2805, "end": 3596}, {"i": 8, "start": 3611, "end": 4166}, {"i": 9, "start": 4180, "end": 4318}, {"i": 10, "start": 4333, "end": 4388}, {"i": 11, "start": 4402, "end": 4763}, {"i": 12, "start": 4777, "end": 5221}, {"i": 13, "start": 5638, "end": 5651}, {"i": 14, "start": 5666, "end": 6054}, {"i": 15, "start": 6069, "end": 6485}, {"i": 16, "start": 6958, "end": 7041}, {"i": 17, "start": 7055, "end": 7096}, {"i": 18, "start": 7111, "end": 7624}, {"i": 19, "start": 7638, "end": 7943}, {"i": 20, "start": 8361, "end": 8486}, {"i": 21, "start": 8500, "end": 8625}, {"i": 22, "start": 8638, "end": 8763}, {"i": 23, "start": 8777, "end": 8874}, {"i": 24, "start": 8888, "end": 9263}, {"i": 25, "start": 9277, "end": 9679}, {"i": 26, "start": 9694, "end": 10138}, {"i": 27, "start": 10152, "end": 10554}, {"i": 28, "start": 10569, "end": 10707}, {"i": 29, "start": 10722, "end": 11110}, {"i": 30, "start": 11430, "end": 11666}, {"i": 31, "start": 11680, "end": 11707}, {"i": 32, "start": 11722, "end": 12055}, {"i": 33, "start": 12069, "end": 12430}, {"i": 34, "start": 12902, "end": 12999}, {"i": 35, "start": 13013, "end": 13138}, {"i": 36, "start": 13152, "end": 13457}, {"i": 37, "start": 13472, "end": 13652}, {"i": 38, "start": 13666, "end": 13971}, {"i": 39, "sta